    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know if i have the energy to \"change the structure\" of anything. it feels like i'm trying to fight an ocean with a spoon. when you look at the math of it all, it's just... it's a zero-sum game. eventually, you just run out of fuel. sometimes it feels more logical to just stop fighting the math and accept that there's no way out. like, why keep playing a game that's rigged to make you lose?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
